url: "https://pixels2genai.art"
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source curriculum that teaches generative art and AI across
  fifteen progressive modules plus a capstone, scaffolding learners from a
  single array element to building, training, and reasoning about modern
  generative models. It is the empirical artifact of a Master's thesis in
  creative computing using Design-Based Research.
